{"claim_type":"fact","confidence":{"factors":["source: secondary","verified: manual"],"score":0.6},"entity_ids":["ent_li2024llatrieval"],"evidence_ids":["ev_rag_injection_defenses_0032"],"id":"claim_rag_retrieval_provenance_nascent_2026","record_type":"claim","status":"active","text":"Synthesis: As of 2026-05, retrieval-side provenance and content-authentication defenses for RAG are nascent \u2014 academic methods (LLatrieval NAACL 2024, Provenance EMNLP-Industry 2024, D-RAG 2025, SAG 2025) and standards-draft work (C2PA 2.2) exist, but no production-deployed RAG system reports end-to-end provenance enforcement integrated with prompt-injection defense.","topic":"rag_injection_defenses"}
